/-!
# M14 same-occurrence canonical regeneration

The economic constitution's world-safe regeneration contract asks for one
constitutional Payment `p` whose own exit fibres, residual rows and revision
disposition yield every factor at once: a same-lineage update (bounded
old-law transport or self-U8), non-contracting ordinary exit, escape of an
exit-kernel fibre, no invisible residual bearer at the generated next, a
successor that keeps its U8 route, and a boundary-crossing residual that keeps
bearer and consumer.

At every generated depth, `p` is that depth's UBI payment occurrence.  The
periodic carrier stores the capture death, the ordinary repair renewal and the
repaired successor produced there, pinned to one renewal; the bounded branch
pays the same-lineage factor.  The next generated by step `depth` is the
occurrence of step `depth + 1`.  At depth zero, where full capture breaks the
policy, the self-U8 branch is generated as well, beside the bounded one.

Producers accept only `depth`.  Certificates hold for every carrier.
-/

